# Raw and derived patient genomic/clinical data — NEVER committed.
# Per the hackathon's Data Transfer Agreement: "I will not release or otherwise
# grant data access to anyone and I will establish appropriate safeguards to
# prevent unauthorized data use." A private GitHub repo is not an approved
# safeguard for this data, and the raw dataset must be deleted (not archived
# in git history) within 30 days of hackathon close. See data-notes/README.md.
data-notes/raw/
data-notes/annotated/
data-notes/*.vcf.gz
data-notes/*.vcf.gz.tbi
data-notes/*.vcf
data-notes/*.bam
data-notes/*.bam.bai
data-notes/*.cram
data-notes/*.cram.crai
*.vcf.gz
*.vcf.gz.tbi
*.vcf
*.bam
*.bam.bai
*.cram
*.cram.crai

# graphify build artifacts — regeneratable from literature/ + notes/ via
# `/graphify graphify-out --update`; not source material.
graphify-out/

# OS/editor/interpreter cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
